Scope

The MIT License above covers VolcaStudio XL's own code, interface assets and
documentation, and the groove template catalog in volcastudio/data/
(grooves.json, grooves-xl.json), which is given to the community under the
same terms.

It does not replace the terms of the parts listed below, which keep their own:

- vendor/korg-syro/ and the SYRO converter built from it (volcastudio-syro):
  Korg Volca Sample SDK, BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c) KORG Inc.
  See vendor/korg-syro/COPYING.
- volcastudio/data/firmware/: the DataBeat OS patch (DataBeat OS's own bytes and
  instructions for applying them to the user's own copy of Korg's volca sample
  1.42 updater). It is not covered by the MIT License; no open-source or
  redistribution licence is granted for DataBeat OS. VolcaStudio XL contains
  no Korg firmware; Korg's updater, downloaded by the user, remains under
  Korg's licence agreement. See THIRD_PARTY.md.
- Packaged builds contain Python, Qt/PySide6 (Desktop App), PortAudio, RtMidi, mido,
  FFmpeg and other runtime components under their own licenses; their notices
  are in the package's licenses/ folder and THIRD_PARTY.md.
